⍝ ==== s2 curses, vows and blessings (Addendum A.4, A.5)

⍝ ‹pcurses› m: a curse mask as written, ⸸ and its letters (ᶠ ⁱ ᵘ ᵈ ᵃ)
⦃
  ⧖:m
  $⸸$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:m △ ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ᶠ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:m #2# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ⁱ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:m #4# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ᵘ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:m #8# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ᵈ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:m #16# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ᵃ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pcurses› ⸫

⍝ ---- the addenda's state: register 62 holds a block [lift fn vow depths flags confessions proven]
⍝ lift: the curses the enclosing ⛨ blocks lift; fn: the record of the function being checked
⍝ (−1 outside one); vow: a ⍤⥀ waiting for its ⥀ (−1); depths: the stack depth after each op of
⍝ the tree, by node (for the vow prover); confessions: the ⛨ tokens met, as a chain [next tok];
⍝ proven: the vows the prover proved, as a chain [next node]; slots 7 … 13 are the prover's
⍝ (vows.trhx)

⦃ ⧖:C,k ⧗:C̵ #62# ‹rd› ⧖:C,b ⧗:C̵ ⧗:b ⧗:k ⊞ ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹a2› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,k,v ⧗:C̵ #62# ‹rd› ⧖:C,b ⧗:C̵ ⧗:b ⧗:k ⊞ ⧗:v ‹wr› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹a2w› ⸫

⍝ ‹a2init› C: the block, and a depth slot for every node of the tree
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,b ⧗:C̵ ○ ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ⧖:C ⧗:C̵ #62# ⧗:b ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #25# ‹rd› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,d ⧗:C̵ #3# ⧗:d ‹a2w› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,n ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:C,k ⧗:C̵,k ⧗:k ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,k ⧗:C̵ ○ ⍆̵ ⧗:k △ ⊟ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦄ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹a2init› ⸫

⍝ ‹setdepth› C op S: the depth after op
⦃ ⧖:C,op,S ⧗:C̵ #3# ‹a2› ⧖:C,d ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n ⧗:C̵ ⧗:d ⧗:op ⊞ ⧗:n ‹wr› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹setdepth› ⸫
⍝ ‹getdepth› C op
⦃ ⧖:C,op ⧗:C̵ #3# ‹a2› ⧖:C,d ⧗:C̵ ⧗:d ⧗:op ⊞ ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹getdepth› ⸫

⍝ ---- recording: a function's own curses (slot 17) and its calls (slot 18, a chain [next callee lift])

⍝ ‹curse› C bits: the function being checked performs these curses (less what is lifted)
⦃
  ⧖:C,bits
  ⧗:C̵ △ ‹a2› ⧖:C,f ⧗:C̵ ○ ‹a2› ⧖:C,lift
  ⧗:C̵,f ⧗:bits ⧗:lift #31# ⩡ ⋒ ⧗:f #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹curse1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹curse› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,f,m ⧗:C̵,f #17# ‹vf› ⧖:C,own ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #17# ⊞ ⧗:own ⧗:m ⋓ ‹wr› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹curse1› ⸫

⍝ ‹cedge› C g: the function being checked calls g
⦃
  ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C̵ △ ‹a2› ⧖:C,f ⧗:C̵ ○ ‹a2› ⧖:C,lift
  ⧗:C̵,f,g,lift ⧗:f #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹cedge1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cedge› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,g,lift
  ⧗:C̵,f #18# ‹vf› ⧖:C,head
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵ ⧗:head ⍆̵ ⧗:g ⍆̵ ⧗:lift ⍆̵ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #18# ⊞ ⧗:e ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cedge1› ⸫

⍝ ‹cursedeco› C f i k deco tok: a function's decorations and token; an FFI binding is worldly
⍝ (forbidden too if declared ⎔⸸ᵘ, and hungry if it returns a string or an array) (A.4)
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,i,k,deco,tok
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #23# ⊞ ⧗:tok ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,i #3# ‹nd› ‹tabs› ⧖:C,nt ⧗:C̵,nt ‹tname› ⧖:C,nm ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #24# ⊞ ⧗:nm ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #21# ⊞ ⧗:deco #-1# ⧗:k #40# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,f,tok ⧗:k #32# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹ffcurse› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cursedeco› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,tok
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹tkd› ⧖:C,tk
  ⧗:C̵,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs ⧗:C̵,outs ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,o ⧗:C̵,outs ‹llen› ⧖:C,no
  ⧗:C̵,o ‹stail› ⧖:C,o2 ⧗:C̵,o ‹shead› ⧖:C,oh
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:o2 ⧗:o ⧗:oh #9676# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ‹tclass› ⧖:C,cl
  #2# ⧗:tk #17# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #4# ⋓ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:cl #3# ᛖ ⧗:no ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ #16# ⋓ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:m
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #17# ⊞ ⧗:m ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ffcurse› ⸫

⍝ ‹opcurse› C op S: what a glyph op does: ⎙ is worldly, ⍆ hungry, ⊙⁻ ⊙⁺ may stop the program
⍝ (worldly), and ⌁ on a particle runs its antiparticle (a call)
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,S
  ⧗:C̵,op ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok ⧗:C̵,tok ‹tc0› ⧖:C,x ⧗:C̵,tok #4# ‹tf› ⧖:C,idx
  ○ ⧗:x #9113# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:x #9030# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #16# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:x #8857# ᛖ ⧗:idx #-1# ᛖ ⧗:idx #-2# ᛖ ⋏ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:m
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹curse› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,S ⧗:x #8961# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹anticurse› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹opcurse› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,S
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,S ⧗:n △ ⊟ ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vty› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t ‹tbase› ⧖:C,b
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,e #8961# ‹scp› ⧗:e,b ‹sapp› ⧗:e ‹send› ⧖:C,an
  ⧗:C̵,an ‹fnfind› ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C̵,g ⧗:n ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⍿⁰ #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹cedge› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹anticurse› ⸫

⍝ ---- ⛨ˣ ⦃ … ⦄: an exorcism lifts the curses x from what its block does (A.4.2)
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,S,strand,dead,depth,locks,ind,prev,to
  ⧗:C̵,op ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,tok #5# ‹tf› ⧖:C,mask
  ⧗:C̵,tok ⧗:mask ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:tk ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $a bare ⛨ prefixes a rite, which ends a cursed particle; an exorcism names its curses, ⛨ⁱ ⦃ … ⦄ (A.4.2, A.6)$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:mask △ ⋒ ○ ᛖ ⧗:mask #8# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:tok #32# ‹cfailunless› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹confess› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ○ ‹a2› ⧖:C,lift0
  ⧗:C̵ ○ ⧗:lift0 ⧗:mask ⋓ ‹a2w› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,S,strand,locks ‹locks› ⧖:C,inner
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:ind △ ⊞ #12# ‹note›
  ⧗:op #3# ⊞ ⧗:S,depth,inner ⧗:ind #2# ⊞ ‹subb› ‹rnew› ⧖:C,r1
  ⧗:C̵ ○ ⧗:lift0 ‹a2w› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,r1 ‹l1› ⧖:C,rs
  ⧗:C̵,rs,tok ○ ⧗:depth ‹join› ⧖:C,S3,strand2,dead2
  ⧗:C̵,strand,strand2 ‹lcat› ⧖:C,strand3
  ⧗:C̵,S3,strand3,dead2 ○ #12# ○
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹c_exorcise› ⸫
⍝ ‹confess› C tok: list the exorcism for --confessions (once, however often its block is checked)
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵ #5# ‹a2› ⧖:C,head
  ⧗:C̵,head,tok ‹confhas› ⧖:C,seen
  ⧗:C̵,head,tok ⧗:seen ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,hd,tk ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵ ⧗:hd ⍆̵ ⧗:tk ⍆̵ ⧖:C ⧗:C̵ #5# ⧗:e ‹a2w› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹confess› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,tok
  ⧗:C̵,e,tok ⊕
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,tok,found
    ⧗:C̵,e,tok,found ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:C,e,tok,found ⧗:C̵,e ‹rd› ⧖:C,nx ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,nx,tok ⧗:found ⧗:t ⧗:tok ᛖ ⋏ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,e,tok,found ⧗:C̵,found
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹confhas› ⸫

⍝ ---- vows (A.5.1): ⍤⥀ ⦃ measure ⦄ before a ⥀, ⍤ᚠ ⦃ measure ⦄ first in ᚠ's body; the measure
⍝ gets copies (or shadows) of the stack and leaves one ℤ
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,S,strand,dead,depth,locks,ind,prev,to
  ⧗:C̵,op ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,tok #5# ‹tf› ⧖:C,isfn
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,S ○ ⧗:n ‹lslice› ⧖:C,vals
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:ind △ ⊞ #13# ‹note›
  ⧗:S,strand,locks ‹locks› ⧖:C,live
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:op #3# ⊞ ⧗:vals,tok ⧗:depth,live ⧗:ind #2# ⊞ ‹measure› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,op,tok,prev,to,depth ⧗:isfn ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹vowloop› ⦄ ⦃ ‹vowfn› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:S,strand,dead ○ ○ ○
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹c_vow› ⸫
⍝ a loop's vow waits for its ⥀, which must come next
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,tok,prev,to
  ⧗:C̵,op #2# ‹nd› ⧖:C,sz
  ⧗:op ⧗:sz ⊞ ⧖:nx
  ⧗:C̵,nx ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,nk
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:nx ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:nk #14# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:tok #33# ‹cfailunless› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #2# ⧗:op ‹a2w›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹vowloop› ⸫
⍝ a function's vow is the first op of its body, and names it
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,tok,prev,to,depth
  ⧗:C̵ △ ‹a2› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,tok #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,e ⧗:tok #9# ⊞ ⧗:tok #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,j,end
    ⧗:C̵,e,j,end ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:C,e,j,end ⧗:C̵,j ‹rd› ⧖:C,c ⧗:C̵,e,c ‹scp› ⧗:e ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ‹send› ⧖:C,nm
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:tok #34# ‹cfailunless› ⧖:C
  ⍝ an instance's name is its key, so compare with the function's own name (slot 24)
  ⧗:C̵,f #24# ‹vf› ⧖:C,cur
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:prev #-1# ᛖ ⧗:depth △ ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:nm ⧗:cur ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:tok #34# ‹cfailunless› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #19# ⊞ ⧗:op ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹vowfn› ⸫

⍝ ‹measure› C b vals tok depth locks ind: a measure block sees copies or shadows of vals and must
⍝ leave exactly one ℤ (like ‹predicate›, which wants a ŧ)
⦃
  ⧖:C,b,vals,tok,depth,locks,ind
  ⧗:C̵,vals ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,PS
  ⧗:C̵,vals,tok,depth,PS ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,vals,tok,depth,PS,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,vals,tok,depth,PS,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,vals,tok,depth,PS,j,n ⧗:C̵,vals,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
        ⧗:C̵,v ‹vty› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
        ⧗:C̵,v,t,tok,depth ⧗:cp ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹pshadow› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,w
        ⧗:C̵,PS,w ‹lpush› ⧖:C,PS2
        ⧗:C̵,vals,tok,depth,PS2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,vals,tok,depth,PS,j,n
  ⧗:C̵,b ‹brange› ⧖:C,from,to
  ⧗:C̵,from,to,PS ⧗:depth △ ⊞ ⧗:locks,ind ‹cblock› ⧖:C,S2,strand,dead
  ⧗:C̵,S2,strand,tok ⧗:dead ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹meascheck› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹measure› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,S2,strand,tok
  ⧗:C̵,S2 ‹ltypes› ⧖:C,ts
  ⧗:C̵ #11# ‹reg› ‹l1› ⧖:C,want
  ⧗:C̵,ts,want ‹leq› ⧖:C,ok
  ⧗:C̵,tok,ts ⧗:ok ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:tk,ts2 ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $a vow's measure must leave exactly [ℤ], but leaves $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ts2 ○ ‹plist› $ (A.5.1)$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:strand ○ ‹noleak›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹meascheck› ⸫

⍝ ‹loopcurse› C op pv: a ⥀ without a vow is restless; one with a vow is restless no longer, and
⍝ if its vow is not proven the function's attributes wait (A.5.3). In a function that cannot
⍝ fail, a ⥀ that may exit with ⊖ stops the program, which is worldly.
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,pv,S,strand
  ⧗:C̵,pv,op,S,strand ⧗:pv #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⦃ ‹vprove› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,r
  ⧗:C̵ #2# ‹reg› ⧖:C,cf
  ⧗:pv #-1# ᛖ ⧖:none
  ⧗:C̵ #8# ⧗:none ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ‹curse› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #2# ⧗:r #2# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ⧗:cf △ ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ‹curse› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:none ‹not› ⧗:r △ ⋒ ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹hopeful› ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧖:C ⧗:C̵,pv ⧗:r △ ⋒ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹vowok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹loopcurse› ⸫
⍝ ‹hopeful› C: the function being checked has an unproven vow
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ △ ‹a2› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f ⧗:f #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,f ⧗:C̵,f #22# ‹vf› ⧖:C,h ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #22# ⊞ ⧗:h △ ⊞ ‹wr› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹hopeful› ⸫

⍝ ‹fnvowend› C f from to: once the body is checked, prove the function's vow (if it has one)
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,from,to
  ⧗:C̵,f #19# ‹vf› ⧖:C,vw
  ⧗:C̵,f,vw,from,to ⧗:vw ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⍿² ⧖:vv ‹vprovefn› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C̵ ⧗:r △ ⋒ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹hopeful› ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:C ⧗:C̵,vv ⧗:r △ ⋒ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹vowok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fnvowend› ⸫

⍝ ---- the prover (A.5.1), deliberately weak: see vows.trhx. Results: bit 1 proven, bit 2 the ⥀
⍝ never exits with ⊖.

⍝ ‹vowok› C node: the prover proved vow node; ‹isproven› C node asks
⦃ ⧖:C,node ⧗:C̵ #6# ‹a2› ⧖:C,hd ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵ ⧗:hd ⍆̵ ⧗:node ⍆̵ ⧖:C ⧗:C̵ #6# ⧗:e ‹a2w› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹vowok› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,node ⧗:C̵ #6# ‹a2› ⧖:C,hd ⧗:C̵,hd,node ‹confhas› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹isproven› ⸫


⍝ ---- the curse sets (A.4): recursion, then a fixpoint over the calls, then the declarations

⍝ ‹cursefix› C
⦃ ‹currec› ‹curfix› ‹curcheck› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cursefix› ⸫

⍝ ‹fnsdo› C code: run ‹fn1› with code on every function record, in definition order
⦃
  ⧖:C,code
  ⧗:C̵ #7# ‹reg› ⧖:C,fns ⧗:C̵,fns ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,fns,code ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,fns,code,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,fns,code,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,fns,code,j,n ⧗:C̵,fns,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,f ⧗:C̵,f,code ‹fn1› ⧗:fns,code ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fnsdo› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,code
  ⧗:C̵,f,code ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹currec1› ⦄ ⦃ ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹curcheck1› ⦄ ⦃ ⍿⁰ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹curpr1› ⦄ ⦃ #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹cscc1› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fn1› ⸫

⍝ ‹ischecked› C f: a function whose body was checked (not an FFI binding, not a generic template)
⦃
  ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f #21# ‹vf› ⧖:C,deco ⧗:C̵,f ‹isgeneric› ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:deco #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:g ‹not› ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹ischecked› ⸫

⍝ ‹sigfail› C f: f may fail: its output is ◌ (its ᶠ comes from its signature)
⦃
  ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs ⧗:C̵,outs ‹llen› ⧖:C,no
  ⧗:C̵,outs ○ ‹lget› ‹shead› ⧖:C,oh
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:no △ ᛖ ⧗:oh #9676# ᛖ ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹sigfail› ⸫

⍝ recursion: a function that calls itself is restless, unless it vows (⍤ᚠ); one in a cycle with
⍝ others is restless whatever it vows (s2's prover looks at direct recursion only)
⦃ △ ‹fnsdo› ‹cscc› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹currec› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f #18# ‹vf› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,e,f ‹edgeto› ⧖:C,self
  ⧗:C̵,f #19# ‹vf› ⧖:C,vw
  ⧗:C̵,f ⧗:self ⧗:vw ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ #8# ‹curse1› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹currec1› ⸫
⍝ ‹edgeto› C e g: the chain of calls from e has a call of g
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,g
  ⧗:C̵,e,g ⊕
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,g,found
    ⧗:C̵,e,g,found ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:C,e,g,found ⧗:C̵,e ‹rd› ⧖:C,nx ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,h ⧗:C̵,nx,g ⧗:found ⧗:h ⧗:g ᛖ ⋏ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,e,g,found ⧗:C̵,found
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹edgeto› ⸫
⍝ ‹cscc› C: a function that its callees call back is restless. A search from each function's
⍝ callees (not itself) marks the functions it meets with the function (slot 25), so each is
⍝ met once per search.
⦃ #4# ‹fnsdo› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cscc› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f
  ⍝ the functions still to visit, a chain [next g]
  ⧗:C̵ #-1# ⧗:f,f ‹cpushc› ⧖:C,st
  ⧗:C̵,f,st ⊕
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,f,st,found
    ⧗:C̵,f,st,found ⧗:st #-1# ᛖ ⧗:found ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹cscc2› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,f,st,found
  ⧗:C̵,f ⧗:found ⋔ ⦃ #8# ‹curse1› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cscc1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,st,found
  ⧗:C̵,st ‹rd› ⧖:C,nx ⧗:C̵ ⧗:st △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C̵,g #25# ‹vf› ⧖:C,mk
  ⧗:g ⧗:f ᛖ ⧖:hit
  ⧗:hit ‹not› ⧗:mk ⧗:f ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⧖:fresh
  ⧗:C̵,nx,g,f ⧗:fresh ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,s,gg,ff ⧗:C̵ ⧗:gg #25# ⊞ ⧗:ff ‹wr› ⧗:s,gg #-1# ‹cpushc› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,st2
  ⧗:C̵,f,st2 ⧗:found ⧗:hit ⋏
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ŧ⟩ ‹cscc2› ⸫
⍝ ‹cpushc› C st h skip: st with every function h calls, but skip
⦃
  ⧖:C,st,h,skip
  ⧗:C̵,h #18# ‹vf› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,st,e,skip
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,st,e,skip
    ⧗:C̵,st,e,skip ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹cpushc1› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹cpushc› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,st,e,skip
  ⧗:C̵,e ‹rd› ⧖:C,nx ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C̵,st,g ⧗:g ⧗:skip ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,s,gg ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,c ⧗:C̵ ⧗:s ⍆̵ ⧗:gg ⍆̵ ⧗:c ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,st2
  ⧗:C̵,st2,nx,skip
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹cpushc1› ⸫

⍝ ‹curfix› C: final = own ∪ ᶠ (from the signature) ∪ the curses of every callee, less ᶠ and what
⍝ the call site lifted; repeated until nothing changes
⦃
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:C ⧗:C̵ ‹curpass› ⧖:C,ch ⧗:C̵ ⧗:ch ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹curfix› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #7# ‹reg› ⧖:C,fns ⧗:C̵,fns ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,fns ○ ⧗:n ⊕
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,fns,j,n,ch
    ⧗:C̵,fns,j,n,ch ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,fns,j,n,ch ⧗:C̵,fns,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,f ⧗:C̵,f ‹curpass1› ⧖:C,c1 ⧗:C̵,fns ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⧗:ch ⧗:c1 ⋏ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,fns,j,n,ch ⧗:C̵,ch
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹curpass› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f #17# ‹vf› ⧖:C,own ⧗:C̵,f ‹sigfail› ⧖:C,sf
  ⧗:own ⧗:sf ⋔ ⦃ △ ⋓ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:m0
  ⧗:C̵,f #18# ‹vf› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,e,m0 ‹edgesor› ⧖:C,m
  ⧗:C̵,f #20# ‹vf› ⧖:C,old
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:f #20# ⊞ ⧗:m ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:m ⧗:old ᛖ ‹not›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹curpass1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,m
  ⧗:C̵,e,m
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,m
    ⧗:C̵,e,m ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:C,e,m ⧗:C̵,e ‹rd› ⧖:C,nx ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,g ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e #2# ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,l
        ⧗:C̵,g #20# ‹vf› ⧖:C,fg
        ⧗:fg ⧗:fg #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:fg2
        ⧗:C̵,nx ⧗:m ⧗:fg2 ⧗:l △ ⋓ #31# ⩡ ⋒ ⋓ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,e,m ⧗:C̵,m
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹edgesor› ⸫

⍝ ‹curcheck› C: declared curses must be the inferred ones (A.4.1), --confess wants them declared,
⍝ and ✧ ✧✧ must hold (A.5.2)
⦃ #2# ‹fnsdo› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹curcheck› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹ischecked› ⧖:C,chk
  ⧗:C̵,f ⧗:chk ⋔ ⦃ ‹curcheck2› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹curcheck1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f #21# ‹vf› ⧖:C,deco ⧗:C̵,f #20# ‹vf› ⧖:C,fin ⧗:C̵,f #23# ‹vf› ⧖:C,tok ⧗:C̵,f ‹rd› ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:deco #4# ≫ #31# ⋒ ⧖:dm
  ⧗:deco #8# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⧖:decl
  ⍝ declared: the same set
  ⧗:C̵,tok,name,fin,dm ⧗:decl ⧗:fin ⧗:dm ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹unspoken› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⍝ --confess: every function but ᛟ declares its curses
  #5855# ‹str1› ⧖:C,entry
  ⧗:C̵,tok,name,fin ⧗:decl ‹not› ⧗:name ⧗:entry ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ‹confessing› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹unconfessed› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⍝ ✧: none of ⁱ ᵘ ᵈ; ✧✧: no curse at all
  ⧗:C̵,tok,name,fin ⧗:deco #2# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:fin #14# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⧗:deco #4# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:fin ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋏
    ⋔ ⦃ ‹fallen› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹curcheck2› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,name,fin,dm
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:fin ⧗:dm #31# ⩡ ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $unspoken curse: $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ $false accusation: $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:name ‹spr› $ is $ ⎙̵ ⧗:fin ‹pcurses› $, but its signature declares $ ⎙̵ ⧗:dm ‹pcurses› $ (A.4.1)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹unspoken› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,name,fin
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $unconfessed: --confess wants every function to declare its curses, and $ ⎙̵ ⧗:name ‹spr›
  $ is $ ⎙̵ ⧗:fin ‹pcurses› $ (A.4.1)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹unconfessed› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,name,fin
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $fallen: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:name ‹spr› $ is declared blessed but is $ ⎙̵ ⧗:fin ‹pcurses› $ (A.5.2)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fallen› ⸫

⍝ ‹confessing›: the command has --confess
⦃
  △ ⊕
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:i,found
    ⧗:i,found ⧗:i ‹argcode› #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:i,found ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:found $--confess$ ⧗:i ‹argeq› ⋏ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:i,found ⧗:found
⦄ ⟨⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹confessing› ⸫

⍝ ---- reports: --curses lists every checked function's curses and blessing; --confessions every
⍝ exorcism (A.4.1)
⦃
  ⧖:C,mode
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:mode #8# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #3# ‹fnsdo› ⦄ ⦃ #5# ‹a2› ‹confpr› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹creport› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹ischecked› ⧖:C,chk
  ⧗:C̵,f ⧗:chk ⋔ ⦃ ‹curpr2› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹curpr1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f #20# ‹vf› ⧖:C,fin ⧗:C̵,f #22# ‹vf› ⧖:C,hop
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹rd› ‹spr› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:fin ‹pcurses›
  ⧗:fin ⧗:fin ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $ ✧✧$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ #14# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ ✧$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:hop ⧗:hop ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ $ (hopeful vows: $ ⎙̵ ᛁ $)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼
  $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹curpr2› ⸫
⍝ ‹confpr› C e: the exorcisms from the chain e on, in the order they were met
⦃
  ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,e ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,e ‹rd› ‹confpr› ⧖:C ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t ‹cpos› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:t ‹ptx› $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹confpr› ⸫
